1850
01:32:16,310 --> 01:32:19,750
- We're taking you back to
Marineville, if we make it.

1851
01:32:19,750 --> 01:32:21,320
And that's more than you deserve.

1852
01:32:21,320 --> 01:32:23,130
- What are our chances, Troy?

1853
01:32:23,130 --> 01:32:24,590
- Well, it all depends
whether this elevator

1854
01:32:24,590 --> 01:32:26,167
moves faster than the lava, Phones.

1855
01:32:26,167 --> 01:32:28,473
And if the volcano doesn't suddenly blow.

1856
01:32:28,473 --> 01:32:30,120
(suspenseful music)

1857
01:32:30,120 --> 01:32:31,320
- [Joel] Pull my finger.

1858
01:32:32,260 --> 01:32:35,743
