1860
01:32:48,070 --> 01:32:50,520
- [Crow] Remember, kids,
milk and lava don't mix.

1861
01:32:52,650 --> 01:32:55,202
- Okay, Phones, hold your breath.

1862
01:32:55,202 --> 01:32:57,702
(tense music)

1863
01:33:04,530 --> 01:33:06,840
- [Joel] Pretty good for
seven miles under the sea.

1864
01:33:06,840 --> 01:33:07,713
- [Crow] Not bad.

1865
